        "heading": "🌈 See Colours as They're Meant to Be Seen",
        "text": "<p>Our High Colour Rendering Index (CRI 90+) technology ensures that every colour in your space appears true to life. Unlike standard LEDs that can wash out or distort colours, our candle bulbs reveal the rich, vibrant hues of your furnishings, artwork, and decor exactly as they were designed to be seen.</p><ul><li><strong>Enhanced skin tones</strong> - People look healthier and more natural</li><li><strong>Vibrant home decor</strong> - Fabrics, artwork, and furnishings display their true colours</li><li><strong>Improved ambiance</strong> - Creates a more inviting and authentic atmosphere</li></ul>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
