        "heading": "💡Over a Decade of LED Expertise Since 2010",
        "text": "<p>Since 2010, LiquidLEDs has been at the forefront of LED lighting technology. Our journey began with a mission to make premium, energy-efficient lighting accessible to everyone while providing exceptional customer service.</p><ul><li><strong>Pioneering LED design</strong> - We've refined our products through years of research and customer feedback</li><li><strong>Trusted by professionals</strong> - Chosen by interior designers, architects, and lighting specialists</li><li><strong>Proven reliability</strong> - Our bulbs are built on generations of technological improvements</li></ul>",
